From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ethan Hill <ethan.hill1999@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:14:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/30] KITKAT-P1: Install 2013 Roboto family and 4.4 window
 animations

- 12 TTFs from android-4.4.4_r1 installed as Roboto2013-* prebuilt fonts;
  sans-serif and sans-serif-condensed repointed to the static 2013 faces in
  all four font configs (fonts.xml is the one that becomes /system/etc/fonts.xml)
- New kitkat-lock-clock family (single Roboto2013-Thin face) for the
  lockscreen clock
- 98 KitKat animation files installed over their modern counterparts
  (activity open/close, task, dialog, toast, submenu, wallpaper, IME,
  screen rotation set); all resource references verified to resolve
